Swift Radio for HarmonyOS
=========================

This project is an unofficial HarmonyOS (ArkTS / ArkUI) port of Swift Radio,
the open-source radio station app for iOS by Matthew Fecher, Fethi El Hassasna
and the Swift Radio contributors.

Upstream project: https://github.com/analogcode/Swift-Radio-Pro
Upstream release this port is based on: v3.1.0

The upstream software is distributed under the MIT License, reproduced in the
LICENSE file at the root of this repository:

