This port reuses upstream source logic, strings, resources and artwork. All of it
remains under that MIT License. Modifications made for the HarmonyOS platform are
released under the same terms.

This port is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by the Swift Radio
authors. Please do not report problems with this port to the upstream project.
The name "Swift Radio" and the Swift Radio app icon belong to their respective
owners; the MIT License covers the source code, not that name or that artwork.


Radio stations
--------------

The example station list in entry/src/main/resources/rawfile/stations.json and
the station logos in entry/src/main/resources/base/media/ are carried over from
upstream Swift Radio. Station names, logos and streams belong to their
broadcasters and are not covered by the MIT License:

* Absolute Country Hits (station_absolutecountry.jpg)
* AZ Rock Radio (az_rock_radio.png)
* The Rock FM (station_therockfm.png)
* Choice Classic Rock (logo loaded from choiceclassicrock.com, as upstream does)
* Radio 1190 (station_radio1190.png)
